fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_observation_status_to_reason %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheObservationBanStatus Option SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceWalkerUnsupportedReason \status:
