fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_no_escape_candidate_record_validate_result %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofRecord Result unit SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofProducerErrorKind \record:
