fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_fresh_witness_loop %impure fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionNoEscapeCandidateRecord impure fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionFreshWitnessTable impure fn i32 impure fn i32 impure fn bool Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceProofTable SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofProducerErrorKind \candidate\witnesses\idx\n\seen:
    if:
        ge idx n
        then:
            if:
                seen
                then:
                    selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_fresh_witness_resource_table_from_candidate candidate
                else:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofProducerErrorKind::RegionFreshWitnessMissing candidate.key
        else:
            match selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_fresh_witness_table_get witnesses idx:
                Option::Some record:
                    selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_fresh_witness_scan_record_result candidate witnesses idx n seen record
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofProducerErrorKind::RegionFreshWitnessRecordReadFailed idx

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_fresh_witness_resource_table_result: candidate と witness から Resource proof table を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - 成功しても Resource proof table owner は module-private のまま caller に返します。request-evidence gate には接続しません。
//: - empty witness table は `RegionFreshWitnessEmpty` として、accepted witness が無い nonempty table は `RegionFreshWitnessMissing` として分けます。
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_fresh_witness_resource_table_result %impure fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionNoEscapeCandidateRecord impure fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionFreshWitnessTable Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceProofTable SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofProducerErrorKind \candidate\witnesses:
